{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは！\nブログを開いてくださりありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46四期生の勝又春です🙌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「Sakurazaka46 ARENA TOUR 2026 -What's lonesome?-」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46に関わってくださる皆さん、\nお一人お一人のおかげで、\n無事に6都市12公演完走することができました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "\\櫻坂46と過ごす夏は、どうでしたか〜？/"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつかのMCでもお話ししましたが、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46とのライブの時間が、皆さんの過去や今のモヤモヤを少しでも吹き飛ばして、これから頑張るためのエンジンになっていたら嬉しいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして私自身も、たくさんの声援や、一面に広がるペンライトを前に、 その光の中に飛び込みたくなるくらい、ライブでは皆さんからたくさんのパワーをもらっています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんな素敵な空間を、皆さんと一緒に作ることができてすごく嬉しいですし、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ライブに限らず、\nBuddiesの皆さんの笑顔をもっともっと増やせるように！と、活動できる毎日が本当に幸せです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46になれて、\nBuddiesに出会えて、\n幸せだなと改めて感じた期間になりました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当に、本当に、ありがとうございました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobMZnAfg.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobKWDzmw.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "くるくる〜"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mob06U55f.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おそらく12公演中、下ろしたのはこの宮城公演1日目のみ😳\nけど、同期や先輩方にも褒めてもらえたからまたしようかな〜👀💭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mob6Y3uxW.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひかるさん\n私からお話しすると、いつも優しく返してくださり、お話を広げてくださいます💕"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobm8CWEr.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "愛季さん\nI will be、いつもイヤモニを外してパフォーマンスや歌声に惚れ込んでいました🫣"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobj2Dspj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゆーづさん\n「写真撮ろうよ〜」と笑顔で来てくださって、いつも脊髄反射で「はいっ！！」と答えてしまいます🙌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobxlowXo.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "りかさん\n気づけばピースが接近してました笑\n港区パセリは、いつもモニター前で全力待機です😉"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobrmilWb.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まつりさん\nいつもどんな時も、この優しい笑顔でお話ししてくださるんです。\n以前ブログでお話しされていた、まつりさんの撮影会。こちらサイドのお写真です...📸💕"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "幸せなことに、まだまだ思い出たくさん！！\nまたお話しさせてください💭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでくださりありがとうございました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "早いものでもう9月🍂\n朝晩と日中で気温差が大きく、\n「秋バテ」という言葉もあるくらいなので、皆さんも体調に気をつけてお過ごしください🙌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、久しぶりのミーグリが！\n楽しみだああーー🥳🥳"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ツアーは終わったけど、\n秋も一緒に過ごしてくれますか〜？☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "勝又 春　#51"}], "source": "official"}